1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,487
Plain recursion needs 2.7

2
00:00:02,487 --> 00:00:03,388
million calls for the

3
00:00:03,388 --> 00:00:04,950
thirtieth Fibonacci number,

4
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,188
but only thirty-one

5
00:00:06,188 --> 00:00:07,500
different answers.

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,513
Where does the waste go?

7
00:00:09,158 --> 00:00:11,471
Here is Fibonacci of five.

8
00:00:11,471 --> 00:00:12,821
Each call splits in two,

9
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:15,333
down to one or zero:

10
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:16,408
fifteen calls.

11
00:00:16,987 --> 00:00:18,400
Most are repeats:

12
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,387
F of three runs twice,

13
00:00:20,387 --> 00:00:22,113
F of two three times,

14
00:00:22,113 --> 00:00:23,800
F of one five times,

15
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,712
F of zero three times.

16
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,563
Only six are different.

17
00:00:27,563 --> 00:00:29,500
Sort the calls into columns,

18
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,338
merge each column into one cell,

19
00:00:32,338 --> 00:00:33,612
and fourteen tree edges

20
00:00:33,612 --> 00:00:35,813
pile onto eight dependencies.

21
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:37,858
Every arrow points right,

22
00:00:37,858 --> 00:00:39,621
so fill left to right.

23
00:00:39,621 --> 00:00:41,483
Zero and one are given;

24
00:00:41,483 --> 00:00:42,608
each next cell adds

25
00:00:42,608 --> 00:00:45,895
the two before it: one, then two,

26
00:00:45,895 --> 00:00:47,996
then three, then five.

27
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,212
Six subproblems instead

28
00:00:50,212 --> 00:00:51,775
of fifteen calls.

29
00:00:51,775 --> 00:00:52,700
And for thirty:

30
00:00:53,088 --> 00:00:55,050
thirty-one subproblems instead of

31
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,787
2.7 million calls.

32
00:00:57,367 --> 00:00:59,067
That's dynamic programming:

33
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:01,229
recurse, but re-use.

34
00:01:01,229 --> 00:01:03,004
Time equals subproblems times

35
00:01:03,004 --> 00:01:04,355
work per subproblem:

36
00:01:04,842 --> 00:01:07,642
here n plus one, times constant,

37
00:01:07,642 --> 00:01:08,417
so order n.
